	<text>
		<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" corresp="signature" n="a"><hi rend="italic">Mit Schnittspuren.</hi></note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Superioribus diebus accepi literas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> tuas, Bullingere doctissime simul et humanissime, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quibus mihi de libello<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><bibl>Curione</bibl>, De omni artificio disserendi atque tractandi summa, <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, Johannes Oporin, August 1547 (<bibl source="b652">VD16</bibl> <ref target="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+C+6426">C6426</ref>)<note type="entity"><persName ref="p714">Curione, Celio</persName>, De omni artificio disserendi atque tractandi summa (1547)</note>; s. dazu <bibl>Kutter</bibl> 135f. - <persName ref="p714">Curione</persName> hatte das Buch mit seinem Brief vom 27. August 1547 (<bibl source="b23">HBBW XX</bibl>, <ref target="file13049">Nr. 3000</ref>) an Bullinger geschickt. Da dieses aber vom Boten nicht überbracht worden war, schickte es <persName ref="p714">Curione</persName> mit seinem Brief vom 24. Oktober 1547 noch einmal; s. <bibl source="b23">HBBW XX</bibl>, <ref target="file13101">Nr. 3052</ref>,31-33.</note> nostro, hoc est de nihilo, gratias agebas, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mihi inquam, qui omnia tibi tuisque omnibus et debeo et volo.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Sed ea <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>es morum suavitate et benignitate animi, ut ex omni parte velis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vincere, non modo beneficiis dandis, sed etiam dissimulandis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunquam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tamen ista tua praeclara dissimulatione assequeris, ut ego me tuum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>esse mancipio et nexu obliviscar.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed mea tenuitas<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi rend="italic">In der Vorlage</hi> tenuita.</note> facit, ut <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tuis in nos meritis respondere non possim.<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p714">Curione</persName> hatte zu dieser Zeit eine nur mittelmäßig besoldete Stelle an der Universität <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> inne; s. <bibl>Kutter</bibl> 123f.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><ptr target="zl18021-2A" type="zzl"/>In iisdem autem literis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>mihi studiosum<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vermutlich der Zürcher Lamprecht (Lampert) Zehnder<note type="entity">Zehnder, Lamprecht</note>, geb. 1527, gest. 1564, Stipendiat<note type="entity">Zurich, Stipendiaten</note> am Zürcher Großmünster<note type="entity">Zurich, Großmünster</note><note type="entity">Zurich, Schulen</note>. Im entsprechendem Zeitraum hat sich kein anderer Zürcher<note type="entity">Zurich</note> in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> eingeschrieben; s. Zürich ZB, Ms Car C 44, S. 923, Nr. 32; <bibl>PfZürich</bibl> 647; <bibl>MBasel</bibl> 53, Nr. 31.<ptr target="fn18021-2" type="zfn"/></note> quendam vestratem commendas diligenter.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><ptr target="zl18021-3A" type="zzl"/>Is venit <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ad me una cum <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglio</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p4091">Huldrych Zwingli</persName> d.J.<note type="entity"><persName ref="p4091">Zwingli, Huldrych</persName> d.J.</note>, der seit Mitte März 1546 in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> studierte und zusammen mit Josias Simler<note type="entity">Simler, Josias</note> und weiteren Zürcher Stipendiaten<note type="entity">Zurich, Stipendiaten</note> bei Konrad Wolfhart (Lycosthenes)<note type="entity">Wolfhart, Konrad</note> wohnte; s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl>, <ref target="file12331">Nr. 2284</ref>, Anm. 13; XVI, Nr. 2378, Anm. 4; XX, Nr. 2872,35f.<ptr target="fn18021-3" type="zfn"/></note>,<ptr target="zl18021-3E" type="zzl"/> quos libenter vidi.<ptr target="zl18021-2E" type="zzl"/></s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Et cum aliis omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tum ei, quem mihi commendabas, me meaque obtuli fecique potestatem, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quoties et quandocunque liberet, me adeundi et me meisque omnibus<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">meisque omnibus: Gemeint ist hier vermutlich insbesondere, was von <persName ref="p714">Curiones</persName> Hausstand dem Studium zuträglich ist.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>utendi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sum praeterea illos ad bonas literas et mores, tum etiam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ad dei sincerum purumque cultum et honorem adhortatus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Reliquum est, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ut tu ad illos scribas, uti libere me quasi patre et meis, ac si sua <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>essent, utantur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nam rariores ad me<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi rend="italic">Über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> sunt, quam vellem.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Sed quid <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>est, mi Bullingere, quod ad me de concilio <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentino</placeName> scribis?</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Etiamne <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>eo <persName ref="p714">Coelius</persName> advocabitur?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Atqui sunt cardinalium et episcoporum ista <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>concilia, non mei similium.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Verum, si mihi eo veniendum est, ego <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Bullingerum meum sequar atque cum eo libenter omnia pericula adire non <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>dubitabo.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Quodsi nec Bullingerus eo, nec <persName ref="p714">Coelius</persName>!</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><ptr target="zl18021-1A" type="zzl"/>Sed extra iocum: <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Ego concilium <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinum</placeName> non procedere audio, quod ipse <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>pontifex<note type="entity">Madruzzo, Christoforo</note><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Kardinal Cristoforo Madruzzo,<note type="entity">Madruzzo, Christoforo</note> Bischof von <placeName ref="l1107">Trient</placeName>.</note>, caesaris<note type="entity"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V</persName>.</note><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V</persName>.<note type="entity"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V</persName>.</note></note> ad papam<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Paul III.<note type="entity">Paul III.</note></note> legatus, id nec a papa ipso, nec ab <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>iis, qui sunt <placeName ref="l55">Bononiae</placeName> concilii specie congregati, obtinere nequiverit.<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Zur Verlegung des Konzils nach <placeName ref="l55">Bologna</placeName> durch Paul III.<note type="entity">Paul III.</note> s. <ref target="18011">18011</ref>, <ref target="fn18011-3" type="fn">fn18011-3</ref>. - Zur Antwort des Papstes<note type="entity">Paul III.</note>, die Madruzzo<note type="entity">Madruzzo, Christoforo</note> vor den Reichsständen übermittelte, s. <ref target="18005">18005</ref>,<ref source="zl18005-2A" target="zl18005-2E" type="zl">18005</ref> mit <ref target="fn18005-1" type="fn">fn18005-1</ref>; <bibl source="b477">Pastor</bibl> V 640.<ptr target="fn18021-1" type="zfn"/></note></s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Consensum enim omnium principum christianorum praetexunt, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sine quo se quicquam immutaturos negant.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Verum caesar<note type="entity"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V</persName>.</note>, ut accepi, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>status<note type="entity"><placeName ref="l822">Deutschland</placeName>, Reichsstände</note> <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName> adhortatus est, ut, quando concilium generale <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l1107">Tridenti</placeName>, ut cupiebat, haberi non potest, paucos<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi rend="italic">In der Vorlage</hi> pauco.</note> quosdam eliqua<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>nt<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Hier vermutlich im Sinne von absondern; s. <bibl source="b440">MLW</bibl> IV 1192f.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>et sortiantur, qui controversias religionis componere moliantur, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>se illorum conatibus ad pacem respicientibus (scilicet<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">scilicet unterstreicht hier die Ironie der Aussage.</note>) nunquam <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>defuturum.<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Zur vom Kaiser<note type="entity"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V</persName>.</note> initiierten Übergangsregelung s. <ref target="18009">18009</ref>,<ref source="zl18009-1A" target="zl18009-1E" type="zl">18009</ref>; <bibl source="b23">HBBW XX</bibl>, <ref target="file13143">Nr. 3094</ref>,19-23 mit Anm. 14f.</note><ptr target="zl18021-1E" type="zzl"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Habes, quae ego acceperim.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Tu vicissim, mi optime <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>frater, si quid habes, quod non dubito, nobiscum communicabis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>per Iesum Christum, unicum servatorem.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta domum<note type="entity">Bullinger</note> tuam totam et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sanctos istos atque doctissimos fratres<note type="entity">Zurich, Pfarrer, Im Gruß</note>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, pridie calendas februarii <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="signature">[Ohne Unterschrift.]</note>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">Adresse auf der Rückseite:</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo theologo d. Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori sanctissimo et <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>vigilantissimo, amico et frat<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ri imprimis observando.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
